        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jeffrey Jey, Maurizio Lobina, Gabry Ponte\n- Organizations: Eiffel 65\n- Products: \"Blue (Da Ba Dee)\", \"Move Your Body\", \"Europop\"\n- Topics: Italian music groups, lead singles, debut albums\n\nFacts:\n- Eiffel 65 is an Italian musical group consisting of Jeffrey Jey, Maurizio Lobina, and Gabry Ponte.\n- \"Blue (Da Ba Dee)\" is a song by the Italian music group Eiffel 65.\n- On 15 January 1999, Eiffel 65 released \"Blue (Da Ba Dee)\" as the lead single from their debut album \"Europop\".\n- In 1999, Eiffel 65 released the studio album \"Europop\".\n- Eiffel 65 is known mainly for the high-charting singles \"Blue (Da Ba Dee)\" and \"Move Your Body\" and for the 1999 studio album \"Europop\".",
